OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry morning with
OL,6,Fbright spells. Cloud will bubble up
OL,7,Fthrough the morning but will lift and
OL,8,Fbreaks into the afternoon. Becoming
OL,9,Fdry, with sunny spells. Feeling
OL,10,Fpleasantly warm for all in a light
OL,11,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine evening to come. A
OL,14,Fclear and dry night for all. Feeling
OL,15,Frather cool or even chilly in rural
OL,16,Fspots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
