OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry and bright morning.
OL,6,FHigh cloud at times will turn the
OL,7,Fsunshine hazy. Light winds will mean
OL,8,Fit'll feel hot to very hot in the
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure remains in charge for the
OL,13,Fnext few days. Although temperatures
OL,14,Fmay dip slightly on Monday, they will
OL,15,Fstart to climb again on Tuesday.
OL,16,FStaying mostly dry throughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
